  "question": {
    "text": "Line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQ</mi></math> is parallel to <math><mi>y</mi></math>-axis and moment of inertia of a rigid body about <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> line is given by <math><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi>x</mi></math> is in meter and <math><mi>I</mi></math> is in <math><mtext>k</mtext><mtext>g</mtext></math>&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The minimum value of <math><mi>I</mi></math> is:<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/99ef80d3-38e1-4669-ad25-40cda36c86bc-image12.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 216px;\" />",
